  "comment": "Instructions on how to successfully setup qemu to emulate an arm vexpress a9/a15 board (and possibly any other arm hw that qemu emulates): 1) setup the rootfs sudo apt -y install qemu-user-static qemu-system-arm sudo apt -y install debootstrap qemu-user-static schroot cd /usr/local/src mkdir arm-test cd /usr/local/src/arm-test mkdir vexpress cd vexpress mkdir qemu-img # 4GBs should be enough dd",
